\cf2 You move in.\par
The shack is quite small, but looks as though it was once the home of some type of hermit.  There is dust everywhere.  There is a fireplace on the far wall.  To one side is a small bed, and over in the corner is a small toilet and hand basin.  Beside the front door is a small window.  Under the window is a large chest.  From the light from the window, you can just make out a hatch in the floor.  Also here is some sellotape.\par
\cf1 \par
pull spring\par
\cf2 You pull the spring from the matress.  It straightens out as you do, and finally snaps off from the mattress.\par
\cf1 \par
