You are standing in a large field of poppies.  All around you, you can see red, swaying in each gust of wind.  The smell of pollen is in the air.  There is a large tree to the north, a river bank to the east, an old stairway to the south, and an old shack to the west.  Also here is an old book and a faded map.\par
